    "created_at": "2018-11-27T15:27:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-11-27T15:27:14Z",
    "body": "What prompted me to file this was my attempt to create an automated test for checking the value of a list item. (With that task, it would probably also be useful to obtain the actual string that is the contents of `li::marker`, which I haven't confirmed is currently possible either.)\r\n\r\nBut I imagine there are also more creative usecases for non-technical purposes (though I acknowledge that CSS may be the preferred option for many of them).",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
