    "updated_at": "2018-11-27T15:29:51Z",
    "body": "We currently use reference tests for those cases: https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/tree/7c50c216081d6ea3c9afe553ee7b64534020a1b2/html/semantics/grouping-content/the-li-element\r\n\r\nIn general there are lots of rendering things that are only testable through ref tests.",
