    "created_at": "2018-11-28T16:20:58Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-11-28T16:20:58Z",
    "body": "I think we'd need to find some concrete use case, and evidence that it's widespread, before we'd consider this. The only one presented so far is writing tests, but we've shown how you can do that already without this new feature being added. (And test-only features are on dubious ground anyway in terms of delivering user value.)",
